# Right click in Fichiers: send the selected files to the iPhone with LocalSend.
[Contractor Entry]
Name=Send to iPhone
Name[fr]=Envoyer à l'iPhone
Icon=phone
Description=Send these files to the iPhone with LocalSend
Description[fr]=Envoyer ces fichiers à l'iPhone avec LocalSend
Exec=@BINDIR@/@APP_ID@ --send %F
MimeType=!inode;
